              "text": "DPF warning back. £1,200 wasted. Engine replacement required."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "According to [KNOWN FAILURE PATTERNS] data for Ford Duratorq engines, injector failure is common between 80,000 and 150,000 miles, with symptoms including black smoke, loss of power, and failed emissions."
